{{/each}}

Call `<object>.list()` to see the functions on an object, each with a one-line
summary. Call a function's `.docs()` — for example `fs.readFile.docs()` — or
`harness.readDocs(fn)` to read its full signature, documentation, and the types it
uses. Only the functions this run offers are bound.
{{/if}}

